  "body": "Please, see [internal structured cloning algorithm](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/infrastructure.html#internal-structured-cloning-algorithm):\n\n> For the purposes of the algorithm above, an object is a particular type of object class if its [[Class]] internal property is equal to class.\n\n`[[Class]]` internal slot was deprecated in favor of [`@@toStringTag`](https://tc39.github.io/ecma262/#sec-object.prototype.tostring). In the spec it was replaced with `Type(value)` syntax for handling basic types (example: [`JSON.stringify`](https://tc39.github.io/ecma262/#sec-serializejsonproperty)).\n",
